<h1>ABOUT CHILD'S HILL FOOD BANK</h1>
<p>The food bank has been set up by a group of local people in partnership with All Saints' Church and many others.</p>
<h3>Where are we?</h3>
<p>Child's Hill Food Bank operates out of All Saints' Church, Child's Hill.</p>
<p>Address: All Saints' Church, Child's Hill, Church Walk, London, NW2 2TJ Telephone: <a href="tel:02074435473">020 7443 5473</a></p>
<h3>Donations</h3>
<p>If you would like to make a donation, ring All Saints Church on <a href="tel:02074435473">020 7443 5473</a>. Organise a local collection If you would like to help.</p>
<h3>All Saints' Church</h3>
<p>Cricklewood Lane, Childs Hill, London, NW2 2TH Tel: <a href="tel:02084559091">020 8455 9091</a></p>
</body></html>
